# TypeScript

Keep `strict` on. Prefer named exports. Share DTOs via `@aether/shared`.
Server uses ESM + NodeNext: import with `.js` extensions for local files.
Client uses Vite bundler resolution (no `.js` extensions).
Do not use `any` unless a vendor type forces it; then isolate and comment.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
export default function helper(data: any) {}

// ✅ GOOD
export function helper(data: HealthResponse): string {
  return data.status;
}